Copied icon asset:
- manager/src/main/res/drawable/ic_monochrome.xml
  (resource filename here: ic_shizuku_monochrome.xml)

The original monochrome vector data is unchanged. Local derivatives:
- ic_launcher_foreground.xml: white tint for a black/white launcher icon.
- ic_launcher_background.xml: local charcoal background.
- ic_launcher.xml: adaptive wrapper referencing the above local resources.
- ic_tile.xml: white paths and a centered viewport for the Quick Settings icon.
The earlier copied color PNG assets are no longer included as of v1.2.2.
Light primary #3F51B5 and dark primary #B1B8DF come from
manager/src/main/res/values/colors.xml; surrounding surface colors are local adaptations.

Shizuku Tile is an independent companion application, not the Shizuku manager.
